  "question": {
    "text": "A solid sphere of radius R has a charge Q distributed in its volume with a charge density &rho; = kr<sup>a</sup>&nbsp;&nbsp;where k and a&nbsp; are constants and r is the distance from its centre. If the electric&nbsp; field at&nbsp; <math> <mrow> <mtext>r</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;is&nbsp;&nbsp; <math><mrow><mfrac linethickness=\"1\"><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></math> &nbsp;times that at r = R, find the value of a.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "From Gauss theorem,<br />&nbsp;<br /><math><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>&prop;</mo><mfrac><mi>q</mi><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math><br /><br />(q = charge enclosed)<br /><br />Therefore<br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>E</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>q</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>q</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <msubsup> <mtext>r</mtext> <mn>1</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msubsup> </mrow> <mrow> <msubsup> <mtext>r</mtext> <mn>2</mn> <mn>2</mn> </msubsup> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or<br /><math> <mrow> <mn>8</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <munderover> <mo>&int;</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mtext>R</mtext> </munderover> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mi>&pi;</mi> <msup> <mtext>r</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <msup> <mtext>&nbsp;kr</mtext> <mtext>deg</mtext> </msup> <mtext>dr</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mrow> <munderover> <mo>&int;</mo> <mn>0</mn> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> <mo>/</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </munderover> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <mi>&pi;</mi> <msup> <mtext>r</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> <msup> <mtext>&nbsp;kr</mtext> <mtext>deg</mtext> </msup> <mtext>dr</mtext> </mrow> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>&times;</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <msup> <mrow> &nbsp;<mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br />&nbsp;<br />Solving this equation we get, a = 2.",
